+SPECIFICATION Spec
+
+INVARIANT TypeOK
+INVARIANT FailureAtomicityInvariant
+INVARIANT CommitResultInvariant
+INVARIANT ReconciliationOrderingInvariant
+INVARIANT RendererOrderingInvariant
